      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "paraboloid_godunov_upwind",
          "description": "Manufactured paraboloid g = r^2 - 0.09, forcing |grad g| = 2 r, S = 1; per-axis Godunov-upwind quantities combined as sqrt(Gx^2 + Gy^2). ||u(T) - g|| = T S ||2 r - sqrt(Gx^2 + Gy^2)|| = O(h). The t=0 assertion pins ic wiring; the t=0.2 assertion bounds the first-order RELATIVE L2 error under the measured cap. Exact per-resolution errors in tests/conformance/convergence/godunov_upwind_D1_2d_paraboloid_mms/golden/errors.json.",
